Dataset

The articles in data/picture-perfect-portfolios.jsonl and data/picture-perfect-portfolios_v2.jsonl, and text derived
from them, come from Picture Perfect Portfolios and are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial
4.0 International licence (CC BY-NC 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

Use must be non-commercial and must credit the source. Alpha Audit adds an attribution line to every answer.

